    # V60z37: Updated column mapping for "Prod. Reg. Status" sheet (99 columns).
    # Source: SAP menu Prod. Reg. Status (bukan Process Pur. Info. Reg.).
    # Yellow-highlighted columns are the ones used; BF (Client Nm.) is green
    # and used only for global client filter (not displayed in table).
